 "name": "Ground Control",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/dragon-vein.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Earth Dragon Soul</em></p>\n<p>As an action for 3 CE, you stomp your foot and transform the ground within 30 ft in one of the following ways:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The ground becomes difficult terrain for all creatures other than yourself.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>All creatures touching the ground other than you must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save they are knocked prone.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You grant creatures of your choice within range three quarters cover until the end of your next turn with earthen walls.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You move one creature touching the ground with a wave of earth up to 20 ft horizontally to a point within range. An unwilling creature must make a Dexterity saving throw to avoid the effect.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
